1
00:00:00,583 --> 00:00:01,875
(Previously...)
Nice to meet you.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,292
I'm Kurobe Harutora.

3
00:00:03,417 --> 00:00:04,917
I'm Kishida Sui, a second-year.

4
00:00:05,042 --> 00:00:06,042
Pleasure to meet you.

5
00:00:06,125 --> 00:00:08,583
Sui is hitting on the underclassman.

6
00:00:09,417 --> 00:00:10,083
You didn't know?

7
00:00:10,208 --> 00:00:12,042
Because this guy is gay.

8
00:00:12,167 --> 00:00:13,833
Wait, is Sui...

9
00:00:13,958 --> 00:00:15,667
(Sorry.)
Into guys?

10
00:00:17,833 --> 00:00:18,958
Welcome back.

11
00:00:19,083 --> 00:00:20,958
When I'm with Harutora,

12
00:00:21,083 --> 00:00:22,917
I can smile so naturally.

13
00:00:23,042 --> 00:00:24,792
Then, when it's just the two of us,

14
00:00:24,917 --> 00:00:26,750
could you take off your mask?

15
00:00:27,458 --> 00:00:28,917
What?

16
00:00:29,292 --> 00:00:30,833
Do you not want to?

17
00:00:31,708 --> 00:00:33,333
It's not that I don't want to...

18
00:00:33,458 --> 00:00:34,875
Can't you?

19
00:00:35,458 --> 00:00:37,125
It's not that I can't.

20
00:00:38,458 --> 00:00:40,042
Please.

21
00:00:40,375 --> 00:00:41,917
Senpai.

22
00:00:43,875 --> 00:00:46,000
But it's so embarrassing.

23
00:00:51,917 --> 00:00:53,583
I'm sorry.

24
00:00:55,875 --> 00:00:58,583
It seems I really like

25
00:01:00,625 --> 00:01:02,208
seeing you all flustered, Senpai.

26
00:01:28,792 --> 00:01:30,042
It's my fault.

27
00:01:30,958 --> 00:01:32,333
I just kissed you on impulse.

28
00:01:34,833 --> 00:01:35,958
I'm going to take a shower.

29
00:02:07,333 --> 00:02:09,208
What was that just now?

30
00:02:16,875 --> 00:02:19,167
I couldn't sleep all night.

31
00:02:26,500 --> 00:02:27,500
Good morning.

32
00:02:28,625 --> 00:02:31,667
Oh, good morning, Senpai.

33
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,292
I'm heading out.

34
00:02:33,958 --> 00:02:35,167
Ah...

35
00:02:40,417 --> 00:02:41,708
Was it a dream?

36
00:02:42,208 --> 00:02:44,500
Probably not...

37
00:02:46,042 --> 00:02:47,542
And this too, while you're at it...

38
00:02:47,667 --> 00:02:48,958
Senpai.

39
00:02:51,083 --> 00:02:52,833
So, are you gonna play?

40
00:02:52,958 --> 00:02:55,458
- We just have to go for it.
- True that.

41
00:02:55,625 --> 00:02:56,958
We need to get ready.

42
00:03:06,875 --> 00:03:08,250
Senpai.

43
00:03:09,125 --> 00:03:10,750
I've already finished cleaning.

44
00:03:21,875 --> 00:03:25,583
He must have just gotten
caught up in the moment.

45
00:03:25,708 --> 00:03:29,042
And Harutora is acting completely normal.

46
00:03:33,208 --> 00:03:37,917
It seems I really like seeing
you all flustered, Senpai.

47
00:03:43,833 --> 00:03:45,042
Senpai.

48
00:03:45,167 --> 00:03:46,917
Have you already taken a shower?

49
00:03:53,042 --> 00:03:54,667
Y-Yeah... Sorry.

50
00:03:54,792 --> 00:03:55,833
No...

51
00:03:55,958 --> 00:03:58,333
I'm the one who lucked out.

52
00:04:04,542 --> 00:04:06,958
Ah... No, that came out wrong.

53
00:04:07,583 --> 00:04:11,667
I meant to say, I'm glad
you didn't get hurt, Senpai.

54
00:04:14,667 --> 00:04:15,875
You scared me.

55
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:18,042
I thought you were like me.

56
00:04:19,208 --> 00:04:20,333
What?

57
00:04:20,458 --> 00:04:24,042
N-Nothing! It's nothing at all.

58
00:04:25,792 --> 00:04:27,958
By the way, Senpai.

59
00:04:28,083 --> 00:04:30,583
Aren't you going to the public bath?

60
00:04:32,208 --> 00:04:33,958
It's just too awkward.

61
00:04:34,083 --> 00:04:35,875
Plus, everyone knows I'm gay now.

62
00:04:38,250 --> 00:04:40,042
So that's why...

63
00:04:45,125 --> 00:04:48,042
Um... In that case,

64
00:04:48,833 --> 00:04:50,792
can't we put a bathtub in the room?

65
00:04:50,917 --> 00:04:52,375
Huh?

66
00:04:55,958 --> 00:04:57,667
Like an open-air bath or something.

67
00:04:57,792 --> 00:04:59,042
What?

68
00:04:59,167 --> 00:05:00,542
Uh...

69
00:05:01,833 --> 00:05:03,750
Or maybe a Goemon bath?

70
00:05:10,833 --> 00:05:13,792
This is exactly what I like about Harutora.

71
00:05:13,917 --> 00:05:16,458
You're really charming.

72
00:05:16,917 --> 00:05:18,000
What?

73
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:20,542
Earnest,

74
00:05:20,667 --> 00:05:22,375
gentle,

75
00:05:23,250 --> 00:05:25,042
and occasionally a bit clueless.

76
00:06:21,625 --> 00:06:24,458
"Hold on, Harutora-kun"
(Episode 2)

77
00:06:30,833 --> 00:06:32,250
Yeah!

78
00:06:32,375 --> 00:06:35,208
Harutora, it's about time to take a break.

79
00:06:36,042 --> 00:06:37,250
Okay.

80
00:06:38,417 --> 00:06:40,792
Um, Senpai.

81
00:06:40,917 --> 00:06:43,167
Aren't you tired from
doing extra practice with me?

82
00:06:43,292 --> 00:06:45,292
Not at all, I'm having fun.

83
00:06:45,417 --> 00:06:48,708
Besides, if no one keeps an eye on you,
you'll just push yourself too hard.

84
00:06:48,833 --> 00:06:50,833
Ah, am I being too nosy?

85
00:06:50,958 --> 00:06:52,750
Not at all, I'm really happy!

86
00:06:59,167 --> 00:07:01,708
Um... Excuse me.

87
00:07:01,833 --> 00:07:04,875
- Yes?
- Could you call that guy over there for me?

88
00:07:12,958 --> 00:07:15,250
Oh, sorry, I'll go get him.

89
00:07:19,292 --> 00:07:22,333
Those two girls said they
want to talk to you, Harutora.

90
00:07:29,083 --> 00:07:30,667
Why?

91
00:07:32,958 --> 00:07:34,667
I think they want to get to know you.

92
00:07:34,792 --> 00:07:36,125
That's not what I'm asking.

93
00:07:36,250 --> 00:07:37,625
What?

94
00:07:41,292 --> 00:07:42,875
Harutora?

95
00:07:47,667 --> 00:07:51,750
It hurts when you say
things like that, Senpai.

96
00:07:52,583 --> 00:07:54,292
It really hurts.

97
00:08:07,042 --> 00:08:09,583
Um... If you don't mind,
could we exchange contacts?

98
00:08:09,708 --> 00:08:11,125
Sorry.

99
00:08:11,250 --> 00:08:12,958
That might not be a good idea...

100
00:08:14,375 --> 00:08:15,792
Huh?

101
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:19,500
What did he mean by that just now?

102
00:08:25,417 --> 00:08:26,417
My poor heart...

103
00:08:26,542 --> 00:08:27,958
I can't take it anymore.

104
00:08:32,125 --> 00:08:33,125
Sui.

105
00:08:33,875 --> 00:08:35,125
Dai-chan.

106
00:08:36,250 --> 00:08:38,130
What's wrong? Why are
you clutching your chest?

107
00:08:38,208 --> 00:08:40,667
Nothing... Just had a sudden palpitation.

108
00:08:40,792 --> 00:08:42,417
What are you, an old man?

109
00:08:43,542 --> 00:08:44,542
By the way,

110
00:08:44,667 --> 00:08:48,417
I saw you hugging that
underclassman earlier.

111
00:08:50,958 --> 00:08:52,500
Are you okay?

112
00:08:53,458 --> 00:08:54,292
Hasn't this happened before?

113
00:08:54,417 --> 00:08:57,833
Someone making you think they like you,
but they're actually just messing with you.

114
00:09:02,458 --> 00:09:03,458
Huh?

115
00:09:03,667 --> 00:09:06,458
What, don't tell me you took it seriously?

116
00:09:06,583 --> 00:09:07,875
Were you waiting for a kiss?

117
00:09:08,375 --> 00:09:09,917
No way.

118
00:09:10,042 --> 00:09:13,208
Who would ever fall for someone like me?

119
00:09:15,208 --> 00:09:17,375
Harutora isn't like that.

120
00:09:19,125 --> 00:09:20,351
He would never do something like that.

121
00:09:20,375 --> 00:09:23,500
Ah... Sorry, you're right.

122
00:09:23,625 --> 00:09:24,893
I know that's probably the case.

123
00:09:24,917 --> 00:09:27,208
I just think you should be careful.

124
00:09:27,333 --> 00:09:29,167
So you don't get the wrong idea.

125
00:09:30,708 --> 00:09:33,583
Yeah, I know.

126
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:38,750
I just lost my balance, and he caught me.

127
00:09:38,875 --> 00:09:40,208
I see.

128
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:42,292
That's good then.

129
00:10:27,833 --> 00:10:30,875
Senpai, welcome back.

130
00:10:32,250 --> 00:10:34,917
Sorry, did I wake you?

131
00:10:35,042 --> 00:10:37,667
No, I was already awake.

132
00:10:37,792 --> 00:10:40,083
You're back really late today.

133
00:10:41,167 --> 00:10:43,167
I was just... studying a bit.

134
00:10:46,250 --> 00:10:50,708
By the way, if you're free this Sunday,

135
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:53,667
do you want to go here?

136
00:10:58,750 --> 00:11:00,167
It's a foot bath.

137
00:11:00,875 --> 00:11:03,417
The scenery there is beautiful.

138
00:11:03,542 --> 00:11:06,917
I figured if we go here, you wouldn't
have to worry about other people, Senpai.

139
00:11:07,042 --> 00:11:09,083
You can just relax.

140
00:11:11,667 --> 00:11:15,125
You're already so busy with the club,

141
00:11:16,792 --> 00:11:18,832
yet you went out of your
way to find this for me...

142
00:11:21,875 --> 00:11:24,000
I just think you should be careful.

143
00:11:24,125 --> 00:11:26,417
So you don't get the wrong idea.

144
00:11:32,125 --> 00:11:34,917
Sorry, never mind.

145
00:11:35,042 --> 00:11:37,458
Ah... Did I get something wrong again?

146
00:11:37,583 --> 00:11:40,542
No, it's just that we have exams next week.

147
00:11:40,667 --> 00:11:42,750
Oh, so that's why you were studying.

148
00:11:42,875 --> 00:11:44,042
Yeah.

149
00:11:45,417 --> 00:11:46,750
Okay, I get it.

150
00:11:47,458 --> 00:11:48,833
Good night.

151
00:12:11,250 --> 00:12:15,500
(Bringing you melting warmth)

152
00:12:16,542 --> 00:12:18,083
It's so pretty.

153
00:12:50,500 --> 00:12:52,250
Is it not over yet?

154
00:12:57,050 --> 00:12:59,257
[Harutora's name is in yellow]

155
00:13:17,250 --> 00:13:18,625
That's amazing.

156
00:13:33,958 --> 00:13:36,208
Sui, what are you doing?

157
00:13:37,208 --> 00:13:38,667
Dai-chan.

158
00:13:39,500 --> 00:13:41,250
You two have a committee meeting too?

159
00:13:41,375 --> 00:13:42,708
What a pain.

160
00:13:42,833 --> 00:13:44,583
And it's going on so late.

161
00:13:45,333 --> 00:13:46,708
Ah...

162
00:13:46,833 --> 00:13:48,083
Not really...

163
00:13:52,708 --> 00:13:53,917
Hey.

164
00:13:56,792 --> 00:13:58,167
Seriously?

165
00:14:07,250 --> 00:14:08,583
I mean,

166
00:14:09,250 --> 00:14:10,875
let's go over there.

167
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:12,208
There's no one around.

168
00:14:15,333 --> 00:14:16,875
Come on.

169
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:18,625
I'll do it for you.

170
00:14:20,125 --> 00:14:22,167
You don't look like you hate it.

171
00:14:26,042 --> 00:14:27,500
Right?

172
00:14:33,083 --> 00:14:34,917
Even if someone looks like they're smiling,

173
00:14:35,667 --> 00:14:37,542
they might actually hate it.

174
00:14:38,625 --> 00:14:41,250
Don't do something so
disrespectful to Senpai.

175
00:14:45,917 --> 00:14:49,542
I'm just kidding, just kidding.

176
00:14:54,917 --> 00:14:57,208
Senpai, are you okay?

177
00:14:58,917 --> 00:15:00,500
Thanks for bailing me out.

178
00:15:00,625 --> 00:15:02,083
I'm really fine.

179
00:15:02,208 --> 00:15:04,625
He was just messing around.

180
00:15:05,083 --> 00:15:08,167
But, I think I just realized
I actually kind of like it.

181
00:15:08,292 --> 00:15:11,167
Being treated aggressively
like that isn't so bad.

182
00:15:17,167 --> 00:15:18,667
I see.

183
00:15:25,375 --> 00:15:26,917
Harutora...

184
00:15:54,583 --> 00:15:56,167
Stop it...

185
00:15:57,208 --> 00:15:58,667
I'm not going to stop.

186
00:15:59,500 --> 00:16:02,000
Isn't this what you wanted, Senpai?

187
00:16:10,708 --> 00:16:16,042
No... Please stop.

188
00:16:20,375 --> 00:16:23,083
Then you should have
made it clear to that guy too!

189
00:16:23,208 --> 00:16:24,917
If you don't like it, say so!

190
00:16:35,167 --> 00:16:37,083
Senpai...

191
00:16:41,875 --> 00:16:43,333
I'm sorry.

192
00:16:52,208 --> 00:16:53,667
I like you...

193
00:17:00,750 --> 00:17:02,292
I like...

194
00:17:02,417 --> 00:17:04,958
I like you, Harutora.

195
00:17:13,792 --> 00:17:17,625
So please don't do this to me anymore.

196
00:17:18,167 --> 00:17:22,792
Everyone has

197
00:17:24,542 --> 00:17:29,458
so many different feelings inside.

198
00:17:47,792 --> 00:17:48,542
Here.

199
00:17:48,667 --> 00:17:50,042
Pass.

200
00:17:50,167 --> 00:17:51,458
Ah, sorry.

201
00:17:54,625 --> 00:17:56,917
Sui, I'm beat. You're up.

202
00:17:57,042 --> 00:17:58,250
Yeah.

203
00:18:04,792 --> 00:18:06,000
Let's go.

204
00:18:08,875 --> 00:18:09,583
Come on!

205
00:18:09,708 --> 00:18:11,208
Here.

206
00:18:11,667 --> 00:18:12,833
Nice!

207
00:18:12,958 --> 00:18:13,958
Again.

208
00:18:16,667 --> 00:18:20,000
Yes!

209
00:18:20,458 --> 00:18:22,625
- Hold on.
- Oh, crap.

210
00:18:23,292 --> 00:18:23,875
Nice block!

211
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:25,500
- Get back on defense!
- Got it!

212
00:18:31,500 --> 00:18:32,833
Harutora...

213
00:18:35,125 --> 00:18:37,125
Then you need to make it clear to him, too!

214
00:18:37,875 --> 00:18:39,750
If you don't want to, just say so.

215
00:18:51,458 --> 00:18:52,458
Sui.

216
00:18:52,792 --> 00:18:54,042
Bring it.

217
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:06,000
- Looking good!
- Push it!

218
00:19:06,042 --> 00:19:07,042
Good.

219
00:19:07,292 --> 00:19:08,792
Nice steal!

220
00:19:14,833 --> 00:19:16,333
Yes!

221
00:19:16,458 --> 00:19:18,667
Are you kidding me?!

222
00:19:19,458 --> 00:19:21,208
Sui!

223
00:19:38,917 --> 00:19:42,500
What am I even doing...?

224
00:20:01,917 --> 00:20:04,667
Um... Harutora.

225
00:20:08,417 --> 00:20:09,792
Senpai.

226
00:20:10,833 --> 00:20:12,583
I'm sorry.

227
00:20:12,708 --> 00:20:14,125
Huh?

228
00:20:17,083 --> 00:20:18,500
I...

229
00:20:20,750 --> 00:20:22,292
Even I...

230
00:20:22,417 --> 00:20:24,958
couldn't figure out my own
feelings for the longest time...

231
00:20:26,958 --> 00:20:28,792
But I finally understand now.

232
00:20:33,625 --> 00:20:35,125
I...

233
00:20:38,167 --> 00:20:39,625
I like you, Senpai.

234
00:20:41,333 --> 00:20:42,792
I really like you.

235
00:20:42,917 --> 00:20:44,458
That's why I did what I did...

236
00:20:50,958 --> 00:20:52,500
I'm sorry...

237
00:20:53,875 --> 00:20:56,000
I ended up hurting you.

238
00:21:05,583 --> 00:21:07,375
Really...?

239
00:21:08,208 --> 00:21:09,708
Huh?

240
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:14,042
Will you really be my boyfriend?

241
00:21:17,625 --> 00:21:19,167
Are you serious?

242
00:21:26,333 --> 00:21:27,958
Of course I will.

243
00:22:14,333 --> 00:22:17,125
Your heartbeat is so calming.

244
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:46,934
(Next Episode Preview)
We can't keep going on like this.

245
00:23:46,958 --> 00:23:48,083
Are you sure it's not?

246
00:23:48,208 --> 00:23:50,000
I told you it's not.

247
00:23:50,125 --> 00:23:52,750
It pisses me off when
people mess with you, Senpai.

248
00:23:52,875 --> 00:23:55,500
Because Harutora said he likes me.

249
00:23:55,625 --> 00:23:57,667
No matter what happens,

250
00:23:57,792 --> 00:24:00,552
(This drama is a work of fiction)
I'll always be by your side, Senpai.
